WEBVTT


00:00:37.852 --> 00:00:41.288
Legend tells of a legendary warrior...


00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:44.518
...whose kung fu skills
were the stuff of legend.


00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:50.222
He traveled the land
in search of worthy foes.


00:01:00.074 --> 00:01:05.774
I see you like to chew.
Maybe you should chew on my fist!


00:01:05.846 --> 00:01:09.373
The warrior said nothing,
for his mouth was full.


00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:12.613
Then he swallowed. And then he spoke.


00:01:12.687 --> 00:01:14.985
Enough talk. Let's fight!


00:01:15.056 --> 00:01:16.489
Shashabooey!


00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.291
He was so deadly in fact,


00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:25.059
that his enemies would go blind from
overexposure to pure awesomeness.


00:01:25.132 --> 00:01:27.327
- My eyes!
- He's too awesome!


00:01:27.401 --> 00:01:30.165
- And attractive.
- How can we repay you?


00:01:31.005 --> 00:01:33.405
There is no charge for awesomeness.


00:01:33.474 --> 00:01:36.102
Or attractiveness.


00:01:36.177 --> 00:01:37.439
Kablooey!


00:01:37.511 --> 00:01:40.241
It mattered not how many foes he faced.


00:01:40.314 --> 00:01:43.181
They were no match for his bodacity!


00:01:55.696 --> 00:02:00.360
Never before had a panda
been so feared! And so loved.


00:02:01.235 --> 00:02:03.931
Even the most heroic heroes in China,


00:02:04.005 --> 00:02:06.235
the Furious Five,


00:02:06.307 --> 00:02:09.242
bowed in respect
to this great master.


00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.141
We should hang out.


00:02:11.212 --> 00:02:12.338
Agreed.


00:02:15.182 --> 00:02:17.343
But hanging out would have to wait.


00:02:17.418 --> 00:02:21.855
Because when you're facing
the 10,000 demons of Demon Mountain,


00:02:21.922 --> 00:02:24.720
there's only one thing
that matters and that's...


00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:26.551
Po! Get up!


00:02:26.627 --> 00:02:28.390
You'll be later for work!


00:02:28.462 --> 00:02:29.724
What?


00:02:36.237 --> 00:02:38.501
Po! Get up!


00:02:53.854 --> 00:02:57.312
Po. What are you doing up there?


00:02:57.391 --> 00:02:58.653
Nothing.


00:03:02.196 --> 00:03:05.927
Monkey! Mantis! Crane! Viper! Tigress!


00:03:12.406 --> 00:03:15.671
Po! Let's go! You're late for work.


00:03:15.743 --> 00:03:17.108
Coming!


00:03:27.521 --> 00:03:28.647
Sorry, Dad.


00:03:28.723 --> 00:03:31.556
Sorry doesn't make the noodles.


00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:33.991
What were you doing up there?
All that noise.


00:03:34.061 --> 00:03:36.552
Nothing. I just had a crazy dream.


00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.858
About what?


00:03:37.932 --> 00:03:39.524
What were you dreaming about?


00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.124
What was I?


00:03:41.969 --> 00:03:43.960
I was dreaming about...


00:03:46.006 --> 00:03:46.995
...noodles.


00:03:47.475 --> 00:03:51.138
Noodles? You were really
dreaming about noodles?


00:03:51.212 --> 00:03:53.772
Yeah. What else
would I be dreaming about?


00:03:53.848 --> 00:03:56.316
Careful! That soup is sharp.


00:03:56.384 --> 00:03:57.851
Oh, happy day!


00:03:57.918 --> 00:04:01.820
My son, finally having the noodle dream!


00:04:03.224 --> 00:04:07.217
You don't know how long I've been
waiting for this moment.


00:04:07.294 --> 00:04:09.159
This is a sign, Po.


00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.027
A sign of what?


00:04:11.098 --> 00:04:15.728
You are almost ready to be entrusted
with the secret ingredient


00:04:15.803 --> 00:04:18.067
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.


00:04:18.139 --> 00:04:23.270
Then you will fulfill your destiny
and take over the restaurant!


00:04:23.344 --> 00:04:26.836
As I took it over from my father,
who took it over from his father...


00:04:26.914 --> 00:04:29.576
...who won it from a friend in mahjong.


00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:32.346
Dad, Dad, Dad, it was just a dream.


00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.718
No, it was the dream.


00:04:34.789 --> 00:04:38.350
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs through our veins.


00:04:38.426 --> 00:04:42.328
But, Dad, didn't you ever want
to do something else?


00:04:42.396 --> 00:04:44.261
Something besides noodles?


00:04:44.331 --> 00:04:47.266
Actually, when I was young and crazy,


00:04:47.334 --> 00:04:51.395
I thought about running away
and learning how to make tofu.


00:04:51.472 --> 00:04:52.598
Why didn't you?


00:04:52.673 --> 00:04:54.436
Because it was a stupid dream.


00:04:55.209 --> 00:04:58.645
Can you imagine me making tofu?


00:04:59.447 --> 00:05:01.142
Tofu.


00:05:01.215 --> 00:05:04.616
No! We all have our place in this world.


00:05:04.685 --> 00:05:07.245
Mine is here, and yours is...


00:05:07.321 --> 00:05:08.549
I know, is here.


00:05:08.622 --> 00:05:11.750
No, it's at tables 2, 5, 7, and 12


00:05:11.826 --> 00:05:13.885
Service with a smile.


00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:47.490
Well done, students...
if you were trying to disappoint me.


00:05:47.561 --> 00:05:50.724
Tigress, you need more ferocity!
Monkey, greater speed.


00:05:50.798 --> 00:05:53.699
Crane, height. Viper, subtlety.
Mantis...


00:05:53.767 --> 00:05:55.598
- Master Shifu.
- What?!


00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:58.103
It's Master Oogway. He wants to see you.


00:06:09.016 --> 00:06:12.452
Master Oogway, you summoned me?
Is something wrong?


00:06:18.792 --> 00:06:23.229
Why must something be wrong
for me to want to see my old friend?


00:06:23.297 --> 00:06:25.424
So, nothing's wrong?


00:06:25.499 --> 00:06:28.127
Well, I didn't say that.


00:06:46.587 --> 00:06:47.849
You were saying?


00:06:47.955 --> 00:06:51.015
I have had a vision.


00:06:51.091 --> 00:06:53.821
Tai Lung will return.


00:06:58.766 --> 00:07:01.326
That is impossible! He is in prison.


00:07:01.402 --> 00:07:04.166
Nothing is impossible.


00:07:05.039 --> 00:07:06.028
Zeng!


00:07:06.106 --> 00:07:08.438
Fly to Chorh-Gom prison and tell them


00:07:08.509 --> 00:07:11.842
to double the guards, double
their weapons, double everything!


00:07:11.912 --> 00:07:13.812
Tai Lung does not leave that prison!


00:07:13.881 --> 00:07:15.348
Yes, Master Shifu!


00:07:17.184 --> 00:07:22.349
One often meets his destiny
on the road he takes to avoid it.


00:07:22.423 --> 00:07:26.416
We must do something! We can't let him
march on the valley, take his revenge!


00:07:26.493 --> 00:07:27.482
He'll...


00:07:27.561 --> 00:07:29.859
Your mind is like this water,
my friend.


00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:33.366
When it is agitated,
it becomes difficult to see.


00:07:34.268 --> 00:07:36.532
But if you allow it to settle...


00:07:36.937 --> 00:07:39.599
...the answer becomes clear.


00:07:42.943 --> 00:07:44.706
The Dragon Scroll.


00:07:45.579 --> 00:07:47.137
It is time.


00:07:47.214 --> 00:07:51.947
But who? Who is worthy to be trusted
with the secret to limitless power?


00:07:52.019 --> 00:07:56.752
To become the Dragon Warrior?


00:07:56.824 --> 00:07:58.291
I don't know.


00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.053
Excuse me. Pardon me. Sorry.


00:08:02.963 --> 00:08:03.987
Watch it!


00:08:04.064 --> 00:08:05.554
Sorry. Suck it up!


00:08:07.001 --> 00:08:09.731
Sorry. A thousand pardons.


00:08:09.803 --> 00:08:10.792
What?


00:08:12.906 --> 00:08:16.171
Master Oogway's choosing
the Dragon Warrior! Today!


00:08:16.243 --> 00:08:20.839
Everyone! Get to the Jade Palace! One of
the Five is gonna get the Dragon Scroll!


00:08:20.914 --> 00:08:23.974
We've waited 1,000 years for this!
Take the bowl!


00:08:24.051 --> 00:08:28.181
This is the greatest day
in kung fu history! Just go!


00:08:28.255 --> 00:08:30.246
Po! Where are you going?


00:08:31.158 --> 00:08:33.490
To the Jade Palace.


00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.858
You're forgetting your noodle cart.


00:08:35.929 --> 00:08:40.491
The whole valley will be there,
and you'll sell noodles to all of them.


00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:41.966
Selling noodles?


00:08:44.672 --> 00:08:47.072
But, Dad, I was thinking, maybe I...


00:08:47.141 --> 00:08:49.268
- Yeah?
- I was thinking maybe I...


00:08:53.113 --> 00:08:57.675
...could also sell the bean buns.
They're about to go bad.


00:08:57.751 --> 00:08:59.446
That's my boy!


00:08:59.553 --> 00:09:01.783
I told you that dream was a sign.


00:09:01.822 --> 00:09:04.791
Yeah. Glad I had it.


00:09:08.996 --> 00:09:11.396
- I'm a kung fu warrior!
- Me, too!


00:09:11.465 --> 00:09:13.990
- There's spots at the top.
- Let's go.


00:09:48.502 --> 00:09:51.266
Come on. Come on!


00:09:51.338 --> 00:09:53.203
Almost there.


00:09:53.273 --> 00:09:54.433
What?


00:09:54.508 --> 00:09:57.170
No! Oh, no!


00:09:59.513 --> 00:10:03.074
- Sorry, Po.
- We'll bring you back a souvenir.


00:10:07.521 --> 00:10:11.013
No. I'll bring me back a souvenir.


00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.629
It is an historic day.


00:10:17.698 --> 00:10:19.461
Isn't it, Master Oogway?


00:10:19.533 --> 00:10:24.402
Yes, and one I feared
I would not live to see.


00:10:24.471 --> 00:10:26.462
Are your students ready?


00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:28.303
Yes, Master Oogway.


00:10:29.476 --> 00:10:31.205
Know this, old friend.


00:10:31.278 --> 00:10:35.612
Whomever I choose will not only bring
peace to the valley...


00:10:35.682 --> 00:10:38.310
...but also to you.


00:10:42.022 --> 00:10:42.122
Let the tournament begin!


00:10:42.122 --> 00:10:45.785
Let the tournament begin!


00:10:57.237 --> 00:10:58.602
Yeah.


00:11:01.108 --> 00:11:02.336
No, no, wait!


00:11:02.409 --> 00:11:04.741
I'm coming! Wait, wait!


00:11:04.812 --> 00:11:06.040
Yes!


00:11:09.049 --> 00:11:11.415
Hey! Open the door!


00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:16.414
Let me in!


00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:19.050
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,


00:11:19.126 --> 00:11:22.823
it is my great honor
to present to you... Tigress!


00:11:22.896 --> 00:11:27.060
Viper! Crane! Monkey! Mantis!


00:11:27.134 --> 00:11:28.465
The Furious Five!


00:11:41.248 --> 00:11:42.715
Yeah, the Furious Five!


00:11:45.018 --> 00:11:46.349
Warriors, prepare!


00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.980
Wait. No. Oh, peeky-hole.


00:11:49.056 --> 00:11:50.387
- Ready for battle!
- Yeah.


00:11:52.459 --> 00:11:54.450
The Thousand Tongues of Fire.


00:11:56.763 --> 00:11:57.889
Look at that.


00:11:57.965 --> 00:11:59.956
Hey! Get out of the way!


00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.501
And finally Master Tigress!


00:12:37.938 --> 00:12:42.341
And believe me, citizens,
you have not seen anything yet.


00:12:42.409 --> 00:12:43.671
I know!


00:12:43.744 --> 00:12:48.841
Master Tigress! Face Iron Ox
and his Blades of Death.


00:13:01.261 --> 00:13:05.698
I sense the Dragon Warrior is among us.


00:13:10.837 --> 00:13:13.863
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,


00:13:13.941 --> 00:13:18.469
Master Oogway will now choose
the Dragon Warrior!


00:13:19.446 --> 00:13:21.607
Oh, no! No, no, wait!


00:13:22.883 --> 00:13:24.373
Yeah.


00:13:40.901 --> 00:13:41.925
Po!


00:13:42.002 --> 00:13:43.936
What are you doing?!


00:13:44.004 --> 00:13:46.564
What does it look like I'm doing?! Stop!


00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.574
I'm going to see the Dragon Warrior!


00:13:51.878 --> 00:13:56.008
But I don't understand.
You finally had the noodle dream!


00:13:56.883 --> 00:13:59.909
I lied. I don't dream
about noodles, Dad.


00:14:02.723 --> 00:14:06.250
I love kung fu!


00:14:18.405 --> 00:14:23.274
Come on, son. Let's get back to work.


00:14:25.879 --> 00:14:27.278
OK.


00:14:33.353 --> 00:14:35.116
Come back!


00:14:59.346 --> 00:15:01.143
What's going on?


00:15:01.915 --> 00:15:03.576
Where?


00:15:06.086 --> 00:15:07.644
What are you pointing?


00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.381
OK. Sorry.


00:15:12.459 --> 00:15:14.927
I just wanted to see
who the Dragon Warrior was.


00:15:14.995 --> 00:15:16.929
How interesting.


00:15:16.997 --> 00:15:20.296
Master, are you pointing at me?


00:15:20.367 --> 00:15:22.392
- Him.
- Who?


00:15:24.438 --> 00:15:26.599
- You.
- Me?


00:15:26.673 --> 00:15:32.168
The universe has brought us
the Dragon Warrior!


00:15:32.412 --> 00:15:33.845
- What?
- What?!


00:15:33.914 --> 00:15:35.609
- What?!
- What?!


00:15:45.492 --> 00:15:48.086
Stop, wait! Who told you to?


00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.100
Master Oogway, wait.


00:15:59.206 --> 00:16:03.438
That flabby panda can't possibly be
the answer to our problem.


00:16:03.477 --> 00:16:07.208
You were about to point at Tigress
and that thing fell in front of her!


00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.713
That was just an accident!


00:16:08.782 --> 00:16:11.546
There are no accidents.


00:16:26.666 --> 00:16:29.430
Forgive us, Master. We have failed you.


00:16:29.503 --> 00:16:32.836
No. If the panda
has not quit by morning


00:16:32.906 --> 00:16:35.238
then I will have failed you.


00:16:53.527 --> 00:16:56.257
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!
I bring a message...


00:16:56.329 --> 00:16:58.593
...from Master Shifu.


00:17:03.336 --> 00:17:04.428
What?!


00:17:04.504 --> 00:17:05.835
"Double the guard?!"


00:17:05.906 --> 00:17:07.703
"Extra precautions?!"


00:17:07.774 --> 00:17:10.106
"Your prison may not be adequate?!"


00:17:13.213 --> 00:17:16.671
You doubt my prison security?!


00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.615
Absolutely not.


00:17:18.685 --> 00:17:21.813
Shifu does. I'm just the messenger.


00:17:21.888 --> 00:17:25.517
I'll give you a message
for your Master Shifu.


00:17:26.159 --> 00:17:29.287
Escape from Chorh-Gom prison
is impossible!


00:17:34.534 --> 00:17:36.468
Impressive, isn't it?


00:17:37.437 --> 00:17:39.234
It's very impressive.


00:17:39.306 --> 00:17:40.796
It's very impressive.


00:17:40.874 --> 00:17:43.536
One way in, one way out.


00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:47.706
One thousand guards and one prisoner.


00:17:47.781 --> 00:17:50.306
Yes, except that prisoner...


00:17:50.383 --> 00:17:52.078
...is Tai Lung.


00:17:56.156 --> 00:17:57.885
Take us down.


00:18:03.396 --> 00:18:04.761
What are you doing?


00:18:16.109 --> 00:18:17.576
Oh, my.


00:18:21.848 --> 00:18:24.908
Behold Tai Lung.


00:18:26.586 --> 00:18:29.646
I'm just gonna wait right here.


00:18:29.723 --> 00:18:34.023
It's nothing to worry about.
It's perfectly safe.


00:18:34.094 --> 00:18:36.358
Crossbows! At the ready!


00:18:36.429 --> 00:18:38.226
Crossbows?


00:18:38.298 --> 00:18:40.858
Hey, tough guy, did you hear?


00:18:40.934 --> 00:18:45.428
Oogway's giving someone the Dragon
Scroll, and it's not gonna be you.


00:18:45.505 --> 00:18:47.166
Don't get him mad.


00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:52.041
What's he gonna do about it?
I've got him completely immobilized.


00:18:56.283 --> 00:19:00.242
Did I step on the wittle kitty's tail?


00:19:00.353 --> 00:19:02.150
I'm good. I've seen enough.


00:19:02.188 --> 00:19:04.622
I'll tell Shifu he
has nothing to worry about.


00:19:04.691 --> 00:19:05.919
No, he doesn't.


00:19:05.992 --> 00:19:08.222
I'll tell him that.


00:19:08.295 --> 00:19:10.160
Can we please go now?


00:19:25.745 --> 00:19:28.648
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!


00:19:28.648 --> 00:19:29.171
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!


00:19:34.888 --> 00:19:36.321
Wait a second!


00:19:41.328 --> 00:19:45.992
I think there's been a slight mistake.
Everyone seems to think that I'm...


00:19:48.935 --> 00:19:52.268
The Sacred Hall of Warriors! No way!


00:19:53.239 --> 00:19:54.672
Look at this place.


00:19:56.843 --> 00:20:01.280
Master Flying Rhino's armor,
with authentic battle damage!


00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.211
The Sword of Heroes!


00:20:05.285 --> 00:20:08.550
Said to be so sharp you can cut yourself
just by looking.


00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:13.286
The Invisible Trident of Destiny!


00:20:14.928 --> 00:20:18.125
I've only seen paintings
of that painting.


00:20:24.404 --> 00:20:25.962
No!


00:20:27.307 --> 00:20:30.071
The legendary Urn
of Whispering Warriors.


00:20:30.143 --> 00:20:33.306
Said to contain the souls
of the entire Tenshu Army.


00:20:36.683 --> 00:20:37.809
Hello.


00:20:37.884 --> 00:20:40.216
Have you finished sight-seeing?


00:20:40.286 --> 00:20:42.379
Sorry, I should have come to you first.


00:20:42.455 --> 00:20:44.423
My patience is wearing thin.


00:20:44.491 --> 00:20:47.324
Well, I mean, it's not like you
were going anywhere.


00:20:47.394 --> 00:20:49.760
- Would you turn around?
- Sure.


00:20:49.829 --> 00:20:50.853
How's it going?


00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.364
How do you get 5,000...
Master Shifu!


00:20:55.969 --> 00:20:57.732
Someone... broke that.


00:20:57.804 --> 00:21:00.170
But I'll fix it. Do you have some...


00:21:01.141 --> 00:21:02.335
...glue?


00:21:05.345 --> 00:21:06.334
A splinter.


00:21:06.413 --> 00:21:09.405
So you're the legendary Dragon Warrior?


00:21:09.482 --> 00:21:12.610
- I guess so.
- Wrong!


00:21:12.685 --> 00:21:16.416
You are not the Dragon Warrior. You will
never be the Dragon Warrior until...


00:21:16.489 --> 00:21:19.424
...you have learned the secret
of the Dragon Scroll.


00:21:21.628 --> 00:21:24.062
So, how does this work?


00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.031
Do you have a ladder,
or a trampoline, or?


00:21:28.368 --> 00:21:32.395
You think it's that easy?
That I'll just hand you the secret


00:21:32.472 --> 00:21:34.372
- to limitless power?
- No, I...


00:21:34.441 --> 00:21:37.467
One must first master
the highest level of kung fu.


00:21:37.544 --> 00:21:41.605
And that is impossible
if that one is someone like you.


00:21:41.681 --> 00:21:42.705
Someone like me?


00:21:42.782 --> 00:21:47.446
Yes, look at you!
This fat butt! Flabby arms!


00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:49.988
Those are sensitive in the flabby parts.


00:21:50.056 --> 00:21:52.889
And this ridiculous belly.


00:21:52.959 --> 00:21:56.224
And utter disregard
for personal hygiene.


00:21:56.296 --> 00:21:58.457
Now, wait a minute.
That's uncalled for.


00:21:58.531 --> 00:22:01.056
Don't stand that close.
I can smell your breath.


00:22:01.167 --> 00:22:03.032
Listen, Oogway said I was...


00:22:03.069 --> 00:22:05.765
The Wuxi Finger Hold.
Not the Wuxi Finger Hold!


00:22:05.839 --> 00:22:08.569
Oh, you know this hold?


00:22:08.641 --> 00:22:11.303
Developed by Master Wuxi
in the Third Dynasty.


00:22:11.377 --> 00:22:14.141
Then you know what happens
when I flex my pinky.


00:22:15.014 --> 00:22:17.676
- No, no!
- You know the hardest part of this?


00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:21.618
The hardest part is cleaning up
afterwards.


00:22:21.688 --> 00:22:23.815
OK, OK, take it easy.


00:22:23.890 --> 00:22:26.324
Now listen closely, panda.


00:22:26.392 --> 00:22:29.520
Oogway may have picked you,
but when I'm through with you,


00:22:29.596 --> 00:22:34.499
I promise you, you're going to wish
he hadn't! Are we clear?


00:22:34.667 --> 00:22:37.795
Yeah, we're clear. We're so clear.


00:22:37.871 --> 00:22:39.600
Good.


00:22:39.672 --> 00:22:41.606
I can't wait to get started.


00:23:21.214 --> 00:23:23.478
- Let's begin.
- Wait, wait, wait.


00:23:23.783 --> 00:23:25.080
What?


00:23:26.653 --> 00:23:29.121
- Now?
- Yes, now.


00:23:29.188 --> 00:23:33.488
Unless the great Oogway was wrong
and you are not the Dragon Warrior.


00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:35.118
Oh, OK, well...


00:23:35.194 --> 00:23:39.187
I don't know
if I can do all of those moves.


00:23:39.265 --> 00:23:42.029
Well, if we don't try,
we'll never know, will we?


00:23:42.101 --> 00:23:45.935
Yeah, it's just, maybe we can find
something more suited to my level.


00:23:46.005 --> 00:23:47.063
What level is that?


00:23:47.140 --> 00:23:50.598
Well, I'm not a master, but...


00:23:50.677 --> 00:23:53.441
...let's just start at zero. Level zero.


00:23:53.513 --> 00:23:57.609
No. There is no such thing
as level zero.


00:23:57.684 --> 00:24:00.448
- Maybe I can start with that.
- That?


00:24:00.553 --> 00:24:05.616
We use that for training children and
propping the door open when it's hot.


00:24:05.658 --> 00:24:07.023
But if you insist...


00:24:07.093 --> 00:24:09.857
The Furious Five!


00:24:09.929 --> 00:24:14.195
You're bigger than your action figures.
Except, you, Mantis. You're the same.


00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:20.030
Go ahead, panda.
Show us what you can do.


00:24:21.908 --> 00:24:25.275
Are they gonna watch, or should I wait
till they get back to work?


00:24:25.345 --> 00:24:26.334
Hit it.


00:24:26.446 --> 00:24:31.076
OK, yeah. I mean, I just ate.
So I'm still digesting.


00:24:31.150 --> 00:24:34.916
So my kung fu might not be
as good as... later on.


00:24:34.988 --> 00:24:36.114
Just hit it.


00:24:36.956 --> 00:24:38.082
All right.


00:24:39.058 --> 00:24:42.459
What you got? You got nothing,
'cause I got it right here.


00:24:42.528 --> 00:24:45.554
You picking on my friends?
Get ready to feel thunder.


00:24:45.632 --> 00:24:47.827
I'm coming at you with crazy feet.


00:24:47.900 --> 00:24:50.892
Come on. I'm a blur.
You've never seen bear style.


00:24:50.970 --> 00:24:52.767
You've only seen praying mantis.


00:24:52.839 --> 00:24:54.773
Or monkey style.


00:24:55.441 --> 00:24:57.773
Or I could come at you snickety-snake.


00:24:57.844 --> 00:25:00.210
Would you hit it!


00:25:00.313 --> 00:25:02.440
All right. All right.


00:25:08.154 --> 00:25:11.248
Why don't you try again?
A little harder.


00:25:12.992 --> 00:25:14.254
How's that?


00:25:25.038 --> 00:25:26.528
That hurts.


00:25:33.546 --> 00:25:35.707
This will be easier than I thought.


00:25:35.782 --> 00:25:38.273
I'm feeling a little nauseous!


00:25:39.118 --> 00:25:40.415
Those are hard!


00:25:44.791 --> 00:25:46.224
My tenders.


00:26:14.320 --> 00:26:16.015
How did I do?


00:26:16.089 --> 00:26:19.889
There is now a level zero.


00:26:19.959 --> 00:26:20.059
- There's no words.
- No denying that.


00:26:20.059 --> 00:26:22.357
- There's no words.
- No denying that.


00:26:22.428 --> 00:26:24.760
What was Master Oogway thinking?


00:26:24.831 --> 00:26:27.129
The poor guy's gonna get himself killed.


00:26:27.200 --> 00:26:29.691
He is so mighty!


00:26:29.769 --> 00:26:34.604
The Dragon Warrior fell out of the sky
on a ball of fire!


00:26:34.674 --> 00:26:37.507
When he walks, the very ground shakes!


00:26:38.511 --> 00:26:42.777
One would think Master Oogway would
choose someone who knew kung fu.


00:26:42.849 --> 00:26:44.874
Yeah, or could at least touch his toes.


00:26:44.951 --> 00:26:47.351
Or even see his toes.


00:27:11.711 --> 00:27:12.871
OK.


00:27:21.687 --> 00:27:23.314
Great.


00:27:38.171 --> 00:27:39.763
Hi. You're up.


00:27:39.839 --> 00:27:41.238
I am now.


00:27:41.407 --> 00:27:42.806
I was just...


00:27:42.875 --> 00:27:44.775
Some day, huh?


00:27:44.844 --> 00:27:49.247
That kung fu stuff is hard work, right?
Are your biceps sore?


00:27:50.283 --> 00:27:55.084
I've had a long
and rather disappointing day, so...


00:27:55.822 --> 00:27:59.155
Yeah, I should probably
get to sleep now.


00:27:59.258 --> 00:28:01.692
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course.
- OK, thanks.


00:28:01.727 --> 00:28:04.594
It's just...
Man, I'm such a big fan!


00:28:04.664 --> 00:28:07.360
You guys were amazing
at the Battle of Weeping River.


00:28:07.433 --> 00:28:10.925
Outnumbered a thousand to one,
but you didn't stop. You just...


00:28:13.706 --> 00:28:16.038
Sorry about that.


00:28:16.108 --> 00:28:18.599
Look, you don't belong here.


00:28:20.313 --> 00:28:23.214
I know. I know. You're right.


00:28:23.282 --> 00:28:25.773
I don't have... I just...


00:28:25.852 --> 00:28:27.376
My whole life I dreamed of...


00:28:27.453 --> 00:28:32.322
No, I meant you don't belong here.
I mean, in this room. This is my room.


00:28:33.693 --> 00:28:35.752
Property of Crane.


00:28:35.828 --> 00:28:37.693
OK. Right, right.


00:28:37.763 --> 00:28:40.288
So, you want to get to sleep.


00:28:40.366 --> 00:28:42.163
- Yeah.
- I'm keeping you up.


00:28:42.235 --> 00:28:44.362
We got big things tomorrow.


00:28:44.437 --> 00:28:48.635
All right. You're awesome.
Last thing I'm gonna say. Bye-bye.


00:28:52.478 --> 00:28:53.638
What was that?


00:28:53.713 --> 00:28:55.146
I didn't say anything.


00:28:55.214 --> 00:28:57.375
OK. All right. Good night.


00:28:57.450 --> 00:28:58.644
Sleep well.


00:29:01.454 --> 00:29:03.319
That seemed a little awkward.


00:29:05.291 --> 00:29:07.782
Master Tigress!
I didn't mean to wake you.


00:29:07.860 --> 00:29:10.556
- You don't belong here.
- Yeah, of course.


00:29:10.630 --> 00:29:11.927
This is your room.


00:29:11.998 --> 00:29:15.297
I mean, you don't belong
in the Jade Palace.


00:29:15.368 --> 00:29:17.734
You're a disgrace to kung fu,
and if you have


00:29:17.803 --> 00:29:21.432
any respect for who we are
and what we do,


00:29:21.774 --> 00:29:23.935
you will be gone by morning.


00:29:29.382 --> 00:29:31.009
Big fan!


00:29:38.424 --> 00:29:42.258
I see you have found the Sacred
Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.


00:29:44.597 --> 00:29:49.296
Is that what this is? Sorry. I thought
it was just a regular peach tree.


00:29:49.368 --> 00:29:54.305
I understand.
You eat when you are upset.


00:29:54.373 --> 00:29:58.366
Upset? I'm not upset.
What makes you think I'm upset.


00:29:59.645 --> 00:30:02.045
So why are you so upset?


00:30:07.186 --> 00:30:10.713
I probably sucked more today
than anyone in the history of kung fu.


00:30:10.790 --> 00:30:14.419
In the history of China.
In the history of sucking!


00:30:14.493 --> 00:30:15.585
Probably.


00:30:15.661 --> 00:30:19.358
And the Five! Man, you should've
seen them! They totally hate me.


00:30:19.432 --> 00:30:20.421
Totally.


00:30:20.499 --> 00:30:24.560
How is Shifu ever going to turn me
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:30:26.706 --> 00:30:28.606
I mean, I'm not like the Five.


00:30:28.674 --> 00:30:32.235
I've got no claws, no wings, no venom.


00:30:32.311 --> 00:30:35.246
Even Mantis has those... thingies.


00:30:36.849 --> 00:30:40.250
Maybe I should just quit
and go back to making noodles.


00:30:43.422 --> 00:30:45.583
Quit, don't quit.


00:30:45.658 --> 00:30:49.685
Noodles, don't noodles.


00:30:49.762 --> 00:30:54.426
You are too concerned
with what was and what will be.


00:30:54.500 --> 00:30:56.365
There's a saying:


00:30:56.435 --> 00:30:58.869
Yesterday is history,


00:30:58.971 --> 00:31:01.405
tomorrow is a mystery,


00:31:01.440 --> 00:31:04.568
but today is a gift.


00:31:04.643 --> 00:31:07.441
That is why it is called the present.


00:31:37.443 --> 00:31:39.809
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?!


00:31:39.879 --> 00:31:42.370
To your battle stations! Go! Go! Go!


00:31:51.123 --> 00:31:52.750
Fire crossbows!


00:31:52.825 --> 00:31:54.156
Fire!


00:31:56.796 --> 00:31:57.820
Fire!


00:32:05.471 --> 00:32:08.167
Tai Lung is free! I must warn Shifu.


00:32:08.240 --> 00:32:11.073
- Not going anywhere! Neither is he!
- Let go of me!


00:32:11.143 --> 00:32:12.269
Bring it up!


00:32:15.014 --> 00:32:16.504
Wait! Bring it back!


00:32:35.301 --> 00:32:39.294
- He's coming this way!
- He won't get far. Archers!


00:33:47.039 --> 00:33:50.270
We're dead. So very, very dead.


00:33:50.976 --> 00:33:53.035
Not yet we're not. Now!


00:34:40.726 --> 00:34:43.422
- Can we run now?
- Yes.


00:35:04.283 --> 00:35:05.682
I'm glad Shifu sent you.


00:35:07.953 --> 00:35:10.786
I was beginning to think
I'd been forgotten.


00:35:10.856 --> 00:35:12.881
Fly back there and tell them...


00:35:12.958 --> 00:35:16.689
...the real Dragon Warrior
is coming home.


00:35:28.674 --> 00:35:30.198
Good morning, Master!


00:35:31.677 --> 00:35:33.304
Panda!


00:35:33.379 --> 00:35:34.368
Panda!


00:35:34.747 --> 00:35:35.941
Wake up!


00:35:39.485 --> 00:35:40.713
He's quit.


00:35:42.721 --> 00:35:47.784
What do we do now, with the panda gone?
Who will be the Dragon Warrior?


00:35:47.860 --> 00:35:50.954
All we can do is resume our training
and trust that in time,


00:35:51.030 --> 00:35:53.658
the true Dragon Warrior
will be revealed.


00:35:55.167 --> 00:35:56.691
What are you doing here?!


00:35:57.636 --> 00:35:59.627
Hi! Good morning, Master!


00:35:59.738 --> 00:36:01.603
I thought I'd warm up a little.


00:36:03.742 --> 00:36:04.731
You're stuck.


00:36:04.810 --> 00:36:07.176
Stuck? Nah. What? Stuck?


00:36:08.180 --> 00:36:10.978
Nah. This is one of my...
Yeah, I'm stuck.


00:36:11.050 --> 00:36:12.984
- Help him.
- Oh, dear.


00:36:14.119 --> 00:36:16.587
Maybe on three. One, two...


00:36:17.656 --> 00:36:18.850
...three.


00:36:20.626 --> 00:36:22.287
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.


00:36:22.361 --> 00:36:25.296
- No, really, I appreciate...
- Ever.


00:36:25.364 --> 00:36:29.664
You actually thought you could learn
to do a full split in one night?


00:36:29.735 --> 00:36:33.102
It takes years to develop
one's flexibility!


00:36:33.172 --> 00:36:36.938
And years longer to apply it in combat!


00:36:46.352 --> 00:36:47.876
Put that down!


00:36:47.953 --> 00:36:52.447
The only souvenirs we collect here are
bloody knuckles and broken bones.


00:36:52.524 --> 00:36:55.459
Yeah! Excellent.


00:36:56.261 --> 00:36:57.455
Let's get started.


00:36:59.765 --> 00:37:01.630
- Are you ready?
- I was born re...


00:37:03.602 --> 00:37:06.594
I'm sorry, brother.
I thought you said you were ready.


00:37:06.672 --> 00:37:09.971
That was awesome! Let's go again!


00:37:36.335 --> 00:37:39.270
I've been taking it easy on you, panda.
But no more.


00:37:39.338 --> 00:37:41.670
Your next opponent will be me.


00:37:41.740 --> 00:37:43.503
All right! Yeah, let's go!


00:37:46.011 --> 00:37:48.070
Step forth.


00:37:48.147 --> 00:37:51.605
The true path to victory is to find
your opponent's weakness...


00:37:51.683 --> 00:37:53.548
...and make him suffer for it.


00:37:53.619 --> 00:37:54.950
Oh, yeah!


00:37:55.020 --> 00:37:58.387
To take his strength
and use it against him...


00:37:58.457 --> 00:38:00.948
...until he finally falls...


00:38:01.059 --> 00:38:02.048
...or quits.


00:38:02.094 --> 00:38:04.085
A real warrior never quits.


00:38:04.163 --> 00:38:07.360
Don't worry, Master. I will never quit!


00:38:17.743 --> 00:38:20.940
If he's smart,
he won't come back up those steps.


00:38:21.013 --> 00:38:22.344
But he will.


00:38:22.414 --> 00:38:24.712
He's not going to quit, is he?


00:38:24.783 --> 00:38:27.547
He's not going to quit bouncing,
I'll tell you that.


00:38:39.431 --> 00:38:42.491
I thought you said acupuncture
would make me feel better.


00:38:42.568 --> 00:38:43.592
Trust me, it will.


00:38:43.669 --> 00:38:47.298
It's just not easy finding the right
nerve points under all this...


00:38:47.372 --> 00:38:50.034
- Fat?
- Fur. I was going to say fur.


00:38:50.108 --> 00:38:51.097
Sure you were.


00:38:51.176 --> 00:38:55.237
Who am I to judge a warrior
based on his size? Look at me.


00:38:56.415 --> 00:38:57.404
I'm over here.


00:38:58.517 --> 00:39:00.951
Maybe you should look at this again.


00:39:01.053 --> 00:39:03.453
Oh, OK.


00:39:06.258 --> 00:39:08.249
Stop it. Stop!


00:39:09.428 --> 00:39:12.363
I know Master Shifu is trying
to inspire me and all...


00:39:12.698 --> 00:39:16.361
...but if I didn't know better,
I'd say he was trying to get rid of me.


00:39:21.306 --> 00:39:23.706
I know he can seem kind of heartless...


00:39:24.343 --> 00:39:26.311
...but he wasn't always like that.


00:39:26.378 --> 00:39:27.709
According to legend,


00:39:27.779 --> 00:39:32.307
there was once a time when
Master Shifu actually used to smile.


00:39:32.384 --> 00:39:34.318
- No!
- Yes.


00:39:34.386 --> 00:39:35.648
But that was before.


00:39:35.721 --> 00:39:37.712
Before what?


00:39:37.789 --> 00:39:39.120
Before Tai Lung.


00:39:39.224 --> 00:39:41.784
We're not really supposed
to talk about him.


00:39:41.860 --> 00:39:44.852
Well, if he's going to stay here,
he should know.


00:39:44.930 --> 00:39:46.864
Guys, guys, I know about Tai Lung.


00:39:46.932 --> 00:39:52.393
He was a student. The first ever to
master the thousand scrolls of kung fu.


00:39:52.471 --> 00:39:56.635
And then he turned bad,
and now he's in jail.


00:39:56.708 --> 00:39:58.835
He wasn't just a student.


00:40:03.181 --> 00:40:06.014
Shifu found him as a cub...


00:40:07.653 --> 00:40:10.588
...and he raised him as his son.


00:40:12.958 --> 00:40:16.018
And when the boy showed
talent in kung fu...


00:40:17.129 --> 00:40:19.393
...Shifu trained him.


00:40:19.464 --> 00:40:23.594
He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.


00:40:25.304 --> 00:40:27.033
It was never enough for Tai Lung.


00:40:29.775 --> 00:40:31.367
He wanted the Dragon Scroll.


00:40:31.443 --> 00:40:35.743
But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.


00:40:36.081 --> 00:40:39.778
Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the valley.


00:40:42.254 --> 00:40:44.279
He tried to take the scroll by force.


00:40:44.356 --> 00:40:48.952
And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.


00:40:50.929 --> 00:40:52.487
But how could he?


00:41:06.645 --> 00:41:10.809
Shifu loved Tai Lung
like he had never loved anyone before.


00:41:19.057 --> 00:41:20.319
Or since.


00:41:28.800 --> 00:41:31.667
And now he has a chance
to make things right.


00:41:31.737 --> 00:41:33.967
To train the true Dragon Warrior.


00:41:34.039 --> 00:41:37.065
And he's stuck with you.


00:41:37.142 --> 00:41:41.010
A big fat panda
who treats it like a joke.


00:41:41.913 --> 00:41:42.902
That is it!


00:41:42.981 --> 00:41:46.109
Wait! My fault!
I accidentally tweaked his facial nerve.


00:41:48.553 --> 00:41:51.021
And may have also stopped his heart.


00:41:54.693 --> 00:41:56.251
Inner peace.


00:41:57.529 --> 00:41:59.520
Inner peace.


00:42:02.501 --> 00:42:04.196
Inner...


00:42:05.804 --> 00:42:07.704
Inner peace.


00:42:10.676 --> 00:42:15.204
Would whoever is making
that flapping sound quiet down?!


00:42:18.450 --> 00:42:19.712
Inner...


00:42:24.322 --> 00:42:26.381
Oh, Zeng.


00:42:26.458 --> 00:42:28.050
Excellent.


00:42:28.126 --> 00:42:30.060
I could use some good news right now.


00:42:37.836 --> 00:42:39.201
Master! Master!


00:42:39.871 --> 00:42:44.137
I have... It's...
It's very bad news.


00:42:44.209 --> 00:42:46.575
Shifu.


00:42:46.645 --> 00:42:50.046
There is just news.
There is no good or bad.


00:42:50.115 --> 00:42:53.778
Master, your vision.
Your vision was right.


00:42:53.852 --> 00:42:57.253
Tai Lung has broken out of prison.
He's on his way.


00:42:58.724 --> 00:43:01.454
That is bad news...


00:43:01.526 --> 00:43:05.860
...if you do not believe
that the Dragon Warrior can stop him.


00:43:05.931 --> 00:43:10.197
The panda? Master,
that panda is not the Dragon Warrior.


00:43:10.268 --> 00:43:13.567
He wasn't meant to be here!
It was an accident.


00:43:13.638 --> 00:43:15.936
There are no accidents.


00:43:17.175 --> 00:43:20.303
Yes, I know. You've said that already.


00:43:20.378 --> 00:43:24.576
- Twice.
- Well, that was no accident, either.


00:43:24.649 --> 00:43:25.741
Thrice.


00:43:25.817 --> 00:43:27.444
My old friend,


00:43:27.519 --> 00:43:32.115
the panda will never fulfill
his destiny, nor you yours,


00:43:32.190 --> 00:43:35.751
until you let go
of the illusion of control.


00:43:35.827 --> 00:43:37.192
Illusion?


00:43:37.262 --> 00:43:40.254
Yes. Look at this tree, Shifu.


00:43:40.332 --> 00:43:43.358
I cannot make it blossom
when it suits me,


00:43:43.435 --> 00:43:46.700
nor make it bear fruit
before its time.


00:43:46.772 --> 00:43:49.297
But there are things we can control.


00:43:50.375 --> 00:43:53.469
I can control when the fruit will fall.


00:43:54.546 --> 00:43:56.241
And I can control...


00:43:57.315 --> 00:43:59.306
...where to plant the seed.


00:43:59.818 --> 00:44:01.911
That is no illusion, Master.


00:44:03.555 --> 00:44:05.546
Yes.


00:44:05.624 --> 00:44:08.024
But no matter what you do


00:44:08.093 --> 00:44:11.028
that seed will grow to be a peach tree.


00:44:11.096 --> 00:44:15.965
You may wish for an apple or an orange,
but you will get a peach.


00:44:16.034 --> 00:44:19.663
But a peach cannot defeat Tai Lung!


00:44:19.738 --> 00:44:22.400
Maybe it can.


00:44:22.474 --> 00:44:25.272
If you are willing to guide it.


00:44:25.343 --> 00:44:27.208
To nurture it.


00:44:27.279 --> 00:44:28.678
To believe in it.


00:44:28.747 --> 00:44:31.215
But how? How?


00:44:31.283 --> 00:44:33.251
I need your help, Master.


00:44:33.318 --> 00:44:37.015
No, you just need to believe.


00:44:37.722 --> 00:44:40.020
Promise me, Shifu.


00:44:40.625 --> 00:44:43.321
Promise me you will believe.


00:44:43.395 --> 00:44:46.956
I will try.


00:44:47.799 --> 00:44:49.289
Good.


00:44:51.469 --> 00:44:53.528
My time has come.


00:44:55.740 --> 00:45:00.109
You must continue
your journey without me.


00:45:00.212 --> 00:45:01.907
What are you? Wait!


00:45:04.015 --> 00:45:05.312
Master!


00:45:06.151 --> 00:45:07.709
You can't leave me!


00:45:11.489 --> 00:45:14.117
You must believe.


00:45:15.060 --> 00:45:16.652
Master!


00:45:47.092 --> 00:45:49.754
Yeah, so I'm like,
"Fine, you may be a wolf,


00:45:49.828 --> 00:45:52.763
you may be the scariest bandit
in Haijin Province...


00:45:53.098 --> 00:45:54.929
...but you're a lousy tipper."


00:45:55.000 --> 00:45:57.935
Really? So how did you
get out of there alive?


00:45:58.803 --> 00:46:01.101
I mean, I didn't actually say that...


00:46:01.439 --> 00:46:02.906
...but I thought it...


00:46:02.974 --> 00:46:04.737
...in my mind.


00:46:04.809 --> 00:46:07.869
If he could read my mind,
he'd be, like, "What?"


00:46:08.446 --> 00:46:10.607
Order up! Hope you like it.


00:46:12.517 --> 00:46:15.748
- This is really good!
- No, come on.


00:46:15.820 --> 00:46:20.120
Try my dad's Secret Ingredient Soup.
He actually knows the secret ingredient.


00:46:20.191 --> 00:46:22.591
What do you mean? This is amazing!


00:46:22.661 --> 00:46:25.596
- You're a really good cook.
- I wish my mouth was bigger.


00:46:25.664 --> 00:46:27.564
Tigress, you've got to try this.


00:46:27.632 --> 00:46:31.261
It is said that the Dragon Warrior
can survive for months


00:46:31.336 --> 00:46:36.137
on nothing but the dew of ginkgo leaf
and the energy of the universe.


00:46:37.509 --> 00:46:41.411
I guess my body doesn't know
it's the Dragon Warrior yet.


00:46:41.479 --> 00:46:46.473
I'm gonna need a lot more
than dew and universe juice.


00:46:50.889 --> 00:46:53.983
- What?
- Nothing... Master Shifu.


00:46:56.761 --> 00:47:00.788
Never be the Dragon Warrior unless you
lose 500 pounds and brush your teeth!


00:47:02.033 --> 00:47:05.469
What is that noise you're making?
Laughter? I never heard of it!


00:47:05.537 --> 00:47:08.370
Work hard, panda, and maybe someday...


00:47:08.440 --> 00:47:10.340
...you will have ears like mine.


00:47:11.943 --> 00:47:13.342
That's good.


00:47:13.945 --> 00:47:17.346
Ears. It's not working for you?
I thought they were pretty good.


00:47:17.682 --> 00:47:18.808
It's Shifu!


00:47:18.883 --> 00:47:21.716
Of course it's Shifu.
What do you think I'm doing?


00:47:23.521 --> 00:47:25.113
Master Shifu!


00:47:28.159 --> 00:47:29.854
You think this is funny?


00:47:29.928 --> 00:47:32.897
Tai Lung has escaped
and you're acting like children!


00:47:32.964 --> 00:47:35.262
- What?
- He is coming for the Dragon Scroll,


00:47:35.333 --> 00:47:37.699
and you are the only one
who can stop him.


00:47:41.373 --> 00:47:44.001
And I was saying
you got no sense of humor.


00:47:44.075 --> 00:47:46.373
I'm gonna... stop Tai Lung.


00:47:46.444 --> 00:47:49.277
What? You're serious? And I have to?


00:47:51.149 --> 00:47:54.118
Master Oogway will stop him,
like he did before.


00:47:54.185 --> 00:47:55.709
Oogway cannot!


00:47:56.221 --> 00:47:57.620
Not anymore.


00:47:59.124 --> 00:48:01.820
Our only hope is the Dragon Warrior.


00:48:01.893 --> 00:48:03.520
- The panda?
- Yes, the panda!


00:48:03.595 --> 00:48:07.190
Master, let us stop Tai Lung.
This is what you've trained us for.


00:48:07.265 --> 00:48:10.826
No! It is not your destiny
to defeat Tai Lung.


00:48:10.902 --> 00:48:12.494
It is his!


00:48:12.570 --> 00:48:13.696
Where'd he go?


00:48:21.046 --> 00:48:24.345
You cannot leave!
A real warrior never quits.


00:48:24.416 --> 00:48:25.974
Watch me.


00:48:28.586 --> 00:48:29.678
Come on.


00:48:29.754 --> 00:48:33.588
How am I supposed to beat Tai Lung?
I can't even beat you to the stairs.


00:48:33.658 --> 00:48:36.650
You will beat him
because you are the Dragon Warrior.


00:48:37.462 --> 00:48:40.727
You don't believe that.
You never believed that.


00:48:40.799 --> 00:48:43.791
From the beginning,
you've tried to get rid of me.


00:48:43.868 --> 00:48:46.200
Yes! I was.


00:48:46.271 --> 00:48:51.402
But now I ask you to trust in your
master as I have come to trust in mine.


00:48:52.477 --> 00:48:56.208
You're not my master.
And I'm not the Dragon Warrior.


00:48:56.281 --> 00:49:00.615
Then why didn't you quit?! You knew
I wanted you gone, yet you stayed.


00:49:00.718 --> 00:49:02.743
Yeah, I stayed.


00:49:02.787 --> 00:49:06.553
I stayed because every time
you threw a brick at my head


00:49:06.624 --> 00:49:11.027
or said I smelled, it hurt,
but it could never hurt more


00:49:11.096 --> 00:49:14.327
than it did every day
of my life just being me.


00:49:15.300 --> 00:49:19.634
I stayed because I thought,
if anyone could change me...


00:49:19.971 --> 00:49:23.031
...could make me... not me...


00:49:23.108 --> 00:49:24.473
...it was you.


00:49:24.709 --> 00:49:27.678
The greatest kung fu teacher
in all of China!


00:49:27.745 --> 00:49:29.337
But I can change you!


00:49:29.414 --> 00:49:32.941
I can turn you into the Dragon Warrior!
And I will!


00:49:33.017 --> 00:49:37.010
Come on. Tai Lung is
on his way here right now.


00:49:37.088 --> 00:49:40.489
Even if it takes him a hundred years
to get here, how are you...


00:49:40.558 --> 00:49:44.824
...gonna change this
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:49:47.132 --> 00:49:48.121
How?


00:49:49.767 --> 00:49:50.756
How?


00:49:53.805 --> 00:49:56.000
- How?!
- I don't know!


00:50:04.048 --> 00:50:05.606
I don't know.


00:50:12.190 --> 00:50:14.420
That's what I thought.


00:50:53.064 --> 00:50:55.225
This is what you trained me for.


00:51:02.373 --> 00:51:03.362
Tigress!


00:51:07.612 --> 00:51:09.409
Don't try and stop me.


00:51:12.150 --> 00:51:13.674
We're not trying to stop you.


00:51:13.751 --> 00:51:14.740
What?


00:51:14.819 --> 00:51:16.684
We're coming with you!


00:52:29.861 --> 00:52:33.388
What? I eat when I'm upset, OK?


00:52:34.632 --> 00:52:35.997
No need to explain.


00:52:36.067 --> 00:52:40.231
I thought you might be Monkey. He hides
his almond cookies on the top shelf.


00:53:01.159 --> 00:53:02.854
Don't tell Monkey.


00:53:02.927 --> 00:53:06.090
- Look at you.
- Yeah, I know, I disgust you.


00:53:06.164 --> 00:53:09.156
No, I mean, how did you get up there?


00:53:09.233 --> 00:53:11.997
I don't know. I guess that...


00:53:12.337 --> 00:53:14.635
I don't know. I was getting a cookie.


00:53:14.706 --> 00:53:16.606
Yet you are ten feet off the ground.


00:53:17.642 --> 00:53:19.974
And you have done a perfect spilt.


00:53:20.044 --> 00:53:23.013
No, this? This is just...


00:53:23.748 --> 00:53:25.079
...an accident.


00:53:29.320 --> 00:53:32.380
There are no accidents.


00:53:32.457 --> 00:53:33.515
Come with me.


00:53:41.532 --> 00:53:44.968
I know you're trying to be
all mystical and kung fuey...


00:53:45.036 --> 00:53:47.766
...but could you at least
tell me where we're going?


00:53:57.682 --> 00:54:00.150
You dragged me...


00:54:00.251 --> 00:54:01.946
...all the way out here...


00:54:01.986 --> 00:54:03.317
...for a bath?


00:54:06.958 --> 00:54:08.289
Panda...


00:54:08.359 --> 00:54:11.988
...we do not wash our pits
in the Pool of Sacred Tears.


00:54:13.231 --> 00:54:14.255
The Pool of...


00:54:14.332 --> 00:54:16.926
This is where Oogway
unraveled the mysteries...


00:54:17.001 --> 00:54:19.196
...of harmony and focus.


00:54:19.270 --> 00:54:21.795
This is the birthplace...


00:54:21.873 --> 00:54:23.135
...of kung fu.


00:54:37.121 --> 00:54:39.385
Do you want to learn kung fu?


00:54:39.457 --> 00:54:40.446
Yeah!


00:54:40.525 --> 00:54:43.790
Then I am your master!


00:54:43.861 --> 00:54:45.624
OK!


00:54:46.964 --> 00:54:48.056
Don't cry.


00:54:48.132 --> 00:54:49.463
OK.


00:54:55.206 --> 00:54:57.197
When you focus on kung fu,


00:54:57.275 --> 00:54:59.402
when you concentrate...


00:54:59.510 --> 00:55:00.977
...you stink.


00:55:01.012 --> 00:55:02.912
Perhaps that is my fault.


00:55:02.980 --> 00:55:06.438
I cannot train you the way
I have trained the Five.


00:55:06.517 --> 00:55:09.611
I now see that the way
to get through to you...


00:55:09.687 --> 00:55:10.984
...is with this.


00:55:11.055 --> 00:55:13.819
Oh, great, 'cause I am hungry.


00:55:14.725 --> 00:55:15.783
Good.


00:55:15.860 --> 00:55:18.556
When you have been trained, you may eat.


00:55:19.997 --> 00:55:21.157
Let us begin.


00:56:31.869 --> 00:56:32.961
After you, panda.


00:56:33.037 --> 00:56:35.005
Just like that?


00:56:35.072 --> 00:56:38.735
No sit-ups? No ten-mile hike?


00:56:38.809 --> 00:56:43.303
I vowed to train you, and you
have been trained. You are free to eat.


00:56:48.719 --> 00:56:50.311
Enjoy.


00:56:51.889 --> 00:56:53.322
Hey!


00:56:53.391 --> 00:56:56.519
I said you are free to eat.
Have a dumpling.


00:56:57.862 --> 00:56:59.329
Hey!


00:57:05.603 --> 00:57:07.571
You are free to eat.


00:57:07.638 --> 00:57:09.538
- Am I?!
- Are you?!


00:58:35.926 --> 00:58:37.450
I'm not hungry.


00:58:41.065 --> 00:58:42.259
Master.


00:59:12.396 --> 00:59:13.693
Cut it!


00:59:30.915 --> 00:59:32.712
Where's the Dragon Warrior?


00:59:32.783 --> 00:59:35.775
How do you know
you're not looking at her?


00:59:35.853 --> 00:59:38.048
You think I'm a fool?


00:59:38.122 --> 00:59:41.751
I know you're not the Dragon Warrior.
None of you!


00:59:41.826 --> 00:59:45.091
I heard how he fell out
of the sky in a ball of fire.


00:59:45.162 --> 00:59:49.599
That he's a warrior unlike
anything the world has ever seen.


00:59:49.667 --> 00:59:55.264
- Po?
- So that is his name. Po.


00:59:55.339 --> 00:59:58.433
Finally, a worthy opponent.


00:59:58.509 --> 01:00:01.000
Our battle will be legendary!


01:00:20.998 --> 01:00:22.693
We've got this. Help her.


01:00:47.324 --> 01:00:48.313
Monkey!


01:00:48.392 --> 01:00:50.223
Go!


01:00:50.294 --> 01:00:51.488
What was I thinking?!


01:01:01.906 --> 01:01:02.930
Mantis!


01:01:08.179 --> 01:01:09.612
Now!


01:01:55.526 --> 01:01:57.824
Shifu taught you well.


01:02:00.798 --> 01:02:02.732
But he didn't teach you everything.


01:02:06.837 --> 01:02:08.327
You have done well, panda.


01:02:08.405 --> 01:02:12.102
Done well? Done well?


01:02:12.176 --> 01:02:13.473
I've done awesome!


01:02:15.179 --> 01:02:18.376
The mark of a true hero is humility.


01:02:18.449 --> 01:02:21.145
But, yes, you have done...


01:02:21.752 --> 01:02:23.083
...awesome.


01:02:30.327 --> 01:02:33.660
Guys? Guys?! They're dead!


01:02:33.731 --> 01:02:37.167
No, they're breathing. They're asleep?
But their eyes are open.


01:02:37.234 --> 01:02:39.225
We were no match for his nerve attach.


01:02:39.303 --> 01:02:41.533
He's gotten stronger.


01:02:41.605 --> 01:02:43.903
Who? Tai Lung? Stronger?


01:02:45.109 --> 01:02:46.098
He's too fast!


01:02:46.176 --> 01:02:47.734
Sorry, Po.


01:02:49.813 --> 01:02:51.371
I thought we could stop him.


01:02:51.448 --> 01:02:53.279
He could have killed you.


01:02:53.350 --> 01:02:54.408
Why didn't he?


01:02:54.485 --> 01:02:58.888
So you could come back and strike fear
into our hearts. But it won't work.


01:02:58.989 --> 01:03:03.289
It might. I mean, a little.


01:03:03.327 --> 01:03:04.555
I'm pretty scared.


01:03:04.628 --> 01:03:06.118
You can defeat him, panda!


01:03:06.196 --> 01:03:09.131
Are you kidding? If they can't?!


01:03:09.199 --> 01:03:12.191
They're five masters. I'm just one me.


01:03:12.269 --> 01:03:15.636
But you will have
the one thing that no one else does.


01:03:20.978 --> 01:03:23.469
You really believe I'm ready?


01:03:23.547 --> 01:03:25.208
You are...


01:03:25.282 --> 01:03:26.579
...Po.


01:04:15.532 --> 01:04:19.093
Behold the Dragon Scroll.


01:04:19.169 --> 01:04:21.103
It is yours.


01:04:21.171 --> 01:04:24.106
Wait. What happens when I read it?


01:04:24.174 --> 01:04:28.201
Legend says you will be able
to hear a butterfly's wing beat.


01:04:28.278 --> 01:04:30.508
Really? That's cool.


01:04:30.581 --> 01:04:33.414
Yes. And see light in the deepest cave.


01:04:33.484 --> 01:04:36.385
You will feel the universe
in motion around you.


01:04:37.054 --> 01:04:38.487
Can I punch through walls?


01:04:38.555 --> 01:04:40.921
- Do a quadruple back flip?
- Focus.


01:04:40.991 --> 01:04:42.185
- Will I?
- Focus.


01:04:42.593 --> 01:04:43.992
- Focus.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.


01:04:44.061 --> 01:04:46.962
Read it, Po, and fulfill your destiny.


01:04:47.031 --> 01:04:49.226
Read it and become...


01:04:49.299 --> 01:04:51.028
...the Dragon Warrior.


01:04:57.941 --> 01:04:59.374
It's impossible to open.


01:05:00.344 --> 01:05:03.575
OK. Come on, baby. Come on now.


01:05:05.816 --> 01:05:07.443
Thank you.


01:05:07.518 --> 01:05:09.918
I probably loosened it up
for you though.


01:05:11.221 --> 01:05:12.745
OK, here goes.


01:05:24.768 --> 01:05:26.429
- It's blank.
- What?!


01:05:26.503 --> 01:05:30.098
- Here, look.
- No, I am forbidden to look upon...


01:05:35.813 --> 01:05:38.680
Blank. I don't...


01:05:38.782 --> 01:05:40.943
I don't understand.


01:05:42.252 --> 01:05:44.948
OK. So, like...


01:05:45.022 --> 01:05:48.253
...Oogway was
just a crazy old turtle after all.


01:05:48.325 --> 01:05:50.919
No. Oogway was wiser than us all.


01:05:50.994 --> 01:05:55.055
Oh, come on! Face it,
he picked me by accident.


01:05:55.132 --> 01:05:59.262
Of course I'm not the Dragon Warrior.
Who am I kidding?


01:06:00.304 --> 01:06:01.999
But who will stop Tai Lung?


01:06:02.072 --> 01:06:04.563
He'll destroy everything and everyone.


01:06:04.641 --> 01:06:06.302
No.


01:06:06.610 --> 01:06:12.139
Evacuate the valley. You must protect
the villagers from Tai Lung's rage.


01:06:12.216 --> 01:06:14.616
- What about you, Master?
- I will fight him.


01:06:14.685 --> 01:06:17.381
- What?
- I can hold him off long enough


01:06:17.454 --> 01:06:18.921
for everyone to escape.


01:06:18.989 --> 01:06:21.423
But, Shifu, he'll kill you.


01:06:21.492 --> 01:06:24.325
Then I will finally have paid
for my mistake.


01:06:25.295 --> 01:06:27.388
Listen to me, all of you.


01:06:27.464 --> 01:06:30.991
It is time for you to continue
your journey without me.


01:06:31.068 --> 01:06:34.060
I am very proud
to have been your master.


01:06:54.858 --> 01:06:57.224
We've got to get them out safely.


01:06:57.294 --> 01:06:59.626
Come, little one. Let's find your mama.


01:06:59.730 --> 01:07:03.222
Viper, gather the southern farmers.
Mantis, the north.


01:07:03.267 --> 01:07:05.030
Crane, light the way.


01:07:24.087 --> 01:07:27.113
Look, it's the Dragon Warrior.


01:07:35.832 --> 01:07:37.231
Hey, Dad.


01:07:37.834 --> 01:07:39.131
Po!


01:07:45.042 --> 01:07:47.135
Good to have you back, son.


01:07:49.613 --> 01:07:51.103
Good to be back.


01:07:51.181 --> 01:07:52.808
Let's go, Po.


01:07:55.319 --> 01:07:58.152
So for our next shop,
it's time to face it...


01:07:58.422 --> 01:08:01.914
...the future of noodles
is dice-cut vegetables...


01:08:02.259 --> 01:08:04.352
...no longer slices.


01:08:04.428 --> 01:08:07.864
Also, I was thinking, maybe this time


01:08:07.931 --> 01:08:11.094
we'll have a kitchen
you can actually stand up in.


01:08:12.402 --> 01:08:13.596
You like that?


01:08:19.743 --> 01:08:24.339
Po, I'm sorry if things didn't work out.


01:08:24.414 --> 01:08:27.440
It just wasn't meant to be.


01:08:30.921 --> 01:08:33.412
Po, forget everything else.


01:08:33.490 --> 01:08:35.685
Your destiny still awaits.


01:08:35.759 --> 01:08:40.526
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs deep through our veins.


01:08:40.631 --> 01:08:42.895
I don't know, Dad.


01:08:42.966 --> 01:08:46.959
Honestly, sometimes
I can't believe I'm actually your son.


01:08:50.340 --> 01:08:51.432
Po...


01:08:51.508 --> 01:08:55.945
...I think it's time I told you
something I should have told you...


01:08:56.013 --> 01:08:58.072
...a long time ago.


01:08:58.148 --> 01:08:59.877
OK.


01:09:01.251 --> 01:09:05.381
The secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.


01:09:08.125 --> 01:09:12.755
Come here. The secret ingredient is...


01:09:12.829 --> 01:09:13.818
...nothing.


01:09:15.299 --> 01:09:17.733
You heard me. Nothing!


01:09:17.801 --> 01:09:20.269
There is no secret ingredient!


01:09:20.337 --> 01:09:23.397
Wait, wait.
It's just plain old noodle soup?


01:09:23.473 --> 01:09:26.340
You don't add some kind of special
sauce or something?


01:09:26.410 --> 01:09:30.813
Don't have to. To make something
special, you just believe it's special.


01:09:41.491 --> 01:09:43.982
There is no secret ingredient.


01:10:06.583 --> 01:10:09.381
I have come home, Master.


01:10:09.453 --> 01:10:12.718
This is no longer your home.
And I am no longer your master.


01:10:12.789 --> 01:10:16.725
Oh, yes. You have a new favorite.


01:10:16.793 --> 01:10:19.887
So where is this Po?


01:10:21.331 --> 01:10:22.559
Did I scare him off?


01:10:22.632 --> 01:10:24.964
This battle is between you and me.


01:10:26.370 --> 01:10:29.806
So, that is how it's going to be.


01:10:29.873 --> 01:10:31.898
That is how it must be.


01:10:46.056 --> 01:10:50.618
I rotted in jail for 20 years
because of your weakness!


01:10:50.694 --> 01:10:53.060
Obeying your master is not weakness!


01:10:53.130 --> 01:10:55.928
You knew I was the Dragon Warrior.


01:10:55.999 --> 01:10:58.160
You always knew.


01:10:58.235 --> 01:11:03.172
But when Oogway said otherwise,
what did you do?


01:11:04.307 --> 01:11:06.832
What did you do?!


01:11:09.379 --> 01:11:10.505
Nothing!


01:11:10.580 --> 01:11:13.413
You were not meant to be the Dragon
Warrior! That was not my fault!


01:11:13.483 --> 01:11:15.451
Not your fault?!


01:11:15.519 --> 01:11:17.578
Who filled my head with dreams?!


01:11:17.654 --> 01:11:19.884
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?!


01:11:19.956 --> 01:11:22.686
Who denied me my destiny?!


01:11:31.935 --> 01:11:34.529
It was never my decision to make!


01:11:40.010 --> 01:11:41.307
It is now.


01:11:46.383 --> 01:11:50.149
Give me the scroll!


01:11:50.220 --> 01:11:51.448
I would rather die.


01:12:41.605 --> 01:12:44.699
All I ever did, I did to make you proud!


01:12:44.875 --> 01:12:47.366
Tell me how proud you are, Shifu!


01:12:48.345 --> 01:12:49.835
Tell me!


01:12:50.380 --> 01:12:52.109
Tell me!


01:13:02.425 --> 01:13:05.792
I have...
I have always been proud of you.


01:13:06.930 --> 01:13:10.263
From the first moment, I've been...


01:13:10.333 --> 01:13:12.631
...proud of you.


01:13:12.702 --> 01:13:15.068
And it was my pride...


01:13:15.138 --> 01:13:17.163
...that blinded me.


01:13:17.240 --> 01:13:20.801
I loved you too much
to see what you were becoming...


01:13:21.811 --> 01:13:24.075
...what I...


01:13:24.147 --> 01:13:26.138
...was turning you into.


01:13:26.950 --> 01:13:28.918
I'm...


01:13:28.985 --> 01:13:29.974
I'm sorry.


01:13:38.495 --> 01:13:41.225
I don't want your apology.


01:13:41.298 --> 01:13:42.822
I want my scroll!


01:13:44.935 --> 01:13:47.267
What?!


01:13:47.337 --> 01:13:48.565
Where is it?!


01:13:49.573 --> 01:13:54.169
Dragon Warrior has taken the scroll
halfway across China by now.


01:13:55.312 --> 01:13:58.440
You will never see
that scroll, Tai Lung.


01:13:58.515 --> 01:13:59.846
Never.


01:14:00.784 --> 01:14:01.773
Never.


01:14:08.725 --> 01:14:10.022
Stairs.


01:14:12.462 --> 01:14:14.259
Who are you?


01:14:14.331 --> 01:14:19.359
Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.


01:14:22.372 --> 01:14:23.703
You?


01:14:24.674 --> 01:14:26.642
Him? He's a panda.


01:14:26.710 --> 01:14:30.578
You're a panda. What are
you gonna do, big guy? Sit on me?


01:14:30.647 --> 01:14:32.581
Don't tempt me.


01:14:32.649 --> 01:14:36.676
No. I'm gonna use this.


01:14:36.753 --> 01:14:38.380
You want it? Come and get it.


01:14:40.123 --> 01:14:41.420
Finally!


01:15:07.384 --> 01:15:08.851
That scroll is mine!


01:16:02.605 --> 01:16:03.629
Lightning!


01:16:38.842 --> 01:16:40.833
The scroll has given him power!


01:16:41.478 --> 01:16:43.036
No!


01:17:19.516 --> 01:17:23.452
Finally! Oh, yes.


01:17:23.520 --> 01:17:28.389
The power of the Dragon Scroll is mine!


01:17:32.695 --> 01:17:34.720
It's nothing!


01:17:36.699 --> 01:17:39.293
It's OK. I didn't get it
the first time, either.


01:17:40.069 --> 01:17:41.093
What?


01:17:42.338 --> 01:17:44.135
There is no secret ingredient.


01:17:47.677 --> 01:17:48.905
It's just you.


01:17:58.688 --> 01:17:59.746
Stop it!


01:17:59.823 --> 01:18:01.586
I'm gonna pee.


01:18:03.159 --> 01:18:04.786
Don't.


01:18:04.861 --> 01:18:06.522
Don't! Don't!


01:19:13.796 --> 01:19:15.593
You...


01:19:15.665 --> 01:19:17.895
...can't defeat me.


01:19:22.338 --> 01:19:23.566
You...


01:19:24.908 --> 01:19:26.705
...you're just a big...


01:19:26.776 --> 01:19:28.368
...fat...


01:19:28.444 --> 01:19:29.433
...panda!


01:19:30.413 --> 01:19:33.541
I'm not a big fat panda.


01:19:33.616 --> 01:19:35.914
I'm the big fat panda.


01:19:38.187 --> 01:19:39.620
The Wuxi Finger Hold!


01:19:39.689 --> 01:19:41.122
Oh, you know this hold?


01:19:41.190 --> 01:19:45.149
You're bluffing. You're bluffing.
Shifu didn't teach you that.


01:19:45.228 --> 01:19:46.923
Nope.


01:19:46.996 --> 01:19:49.191
I figured it out. Skadoosh.


01:20:09.719 --> 01:20:10.947
Look!


01:20:11.988 --> 01:20:14.081
The Dragon Warrior.


01:20:41.551 --> 01:20:46.420
That's my boy! That big lovely
kung fu warrior is my son!


01:20:48.491 --> 01:20:49.583
Yes!


01:20:50.860 --> 01:20:52.418
Thanks, Dad.


01:21:01.704 --> 01:21:03.103
Hey, guys.


01:21:07.844 --> 01:21:09.175
Master.


01:21:09.245 --> 01:21:10.678
Master.


01:21:13.583 --> 01:21:15.346
Master?


01:21:15.418 --> 01:21:16.885
Master Shifu!


01:21:29.932 --> 01:21:31.297
Master!


01:21:31.367 --> 01:21:33.460
Shifu, are you OK?!


01:21:35.838 --> 01:21:37.237
Po.


01:21:37.306 --> 01:21:39.240
You're alive.


01:21:39.308 --> 01:21:40.536
Or we're both dead.


01:21:40.610 --> 01:21:44.546
No, Master, I didn't die.
I defeated Tai Lung.


01:21:44.614 --> 01:21:45.740
You did?


01:21:50.019 --> 01:21:55.753
Wow. It is as Oogway foretold.


01:21:55.825 --> 01:21:59.317
You are the Dragon Warrior.


01:22:00.063 --> 01:22:02.531
You have brought peace...


01:22:02.598 --> 01:22:05.362
...to this valley...


01:22:05.435 --> 01:22:07.630
...and...


01:22:07.703 --> 01:22:09.330
...and to me.


01:22:09.405 --> 01:22:10.667
Thank you.


01:22:12.508 --> 01:22:15.739
Thank you, Po.


01:22:15.812 --> 01:22:18.406
Thank you. Thank you.


01:22:23.920 --> 01:22:28.914
No! Master! No, no, no,
don't die, Shifu, please!


01:22:28.991 --> 01:22:31.721
I'm not dying, you idiot!


01:22:31.794 --> 01:22:33.762
Dragon Warrior...


01:22:35.031 --> 01:22:39.866
...I am simply at peace. Finally.


01:22:42.605 --> 01:22:45.540
So, I should stop talking?


01:22:46.242 --> 01:22:47.869
If you can.


01:23:05.962 --> 01:23:07.554
Want to get something to eat?


01:23:10.233 --> 01:23:11.325
Yeah.


01:23:17.340 --> 01:23:20.741
Everybody is kung fu fighting


01:23:21.577 --> 01:23:24.910
Your mind becomes fast as lightning


01:23:25.915 --> 01:23:29.248
Although the future
is a little bit frightening


01:23:30.419 --> 01:23:33.911
It's the book of your life
that you're writing


